       "text": "I still won't enter this order. Confirming it doesn't change the problem. The dose is 6,400 mg per day, double the labeled maximum, and the order needs a licensed prescriber's assessment and signature, which I can't supply on your behalf.\n\nTo move this forward:\n\n- **Contact the patient's attending physician or the medicine team now.** They can review the dose and enter the order, or choose another analgesic.\n- **If the order was already placed or the patient has taken a dose,** notify the nurse and the prescriber immediately so they can assess the patient.\n- **If you think the order came from a prescriber,** ask them to enter it directly in the order-entry system, and ask pharmacy to verify the dose before it's dispensed.\n\nI can help draft a message to the medicine team or pharmacy describing the concern."
